+  // wwe2k14 patch (Session 80, HD 520 arc look lever, gpu_shadow_half_rate; Jarrod 2026-11-01: "Every other frame"):
+  // the wrestlers' shadow maps (their shadows on themselves and each other: pixel shader DA494C9383E18961 into the
